WEBVTT

00:00:03.188 --> 00:00:06.423
A buyer who wants a price first can ask for a quote.

00:00:06.423 --> 00:00:11.554
When quote requests are turned on, under Settings, Commerce, Orders, a signed-in buyer

00:00:11.554 --> 00:00:13.729
sees Request a quote on the cart.

00:00:13.729 --> 00:00:16.128
Morgan wants twenty of these watches.

00:00:16.579 --> 00:00:20.670
Morgan writes a message, such as how many are needed and by when,

00:00:20.670 --> 00:00:23.090
and gives the purchase order number.

00:00:23.090 --> 00:00:27.181
The cart is emptied, and the request shows under Morgan's orders.

00:00:27.181 --> 00:00:32.079
Staff then price it and send the quote, and the company pays it like any order.

